Stumbling through the source in priest.c hints that (gold=gold you carry):



Give 0 to a co-aligned priest, reduce alignment.  To a non aligned priest,
no result.  Message:  "Thou shalt regret thine action"

Give <200*level, and gold>2*offer to any priest, no result.  Message: 
"Cheapskate".
give <200*level, and gold<2*offer to any priest, exercise wisdom.  Message:
 "I thank thee for thy contribution"

Give 200-400*level to any priest, message:  "Thou art indeed a pious
individual"
If gold<2*offer, gain clarivoyance for a random time.  If a co-aligned
priest and your alignment<-5, increase alignment.  Message: "I bestow upon
thee a blessing"

Give 400-600*level, gain intrinsic protection (from 2 to 5 AC).  If already
protected, increase protection by 1 (up to a hard limit of 20, with reduced
chances if intrinsic AC > 9).  Message:  "Thy devotion has been rewarded"

Give >600*level (if gold<2*offer) to a co-aligned priest could cleanse you
if your alignment is "strayed", or increase alignment by 2.  To a
non-aligned priest, no result.  Message (in any case):  "Thy selfless
generosity is deeply appreciated"

Basically, give all you can afford in the 400-600*level range to increase
AC.  Drop gold outside the temple to reduce your inventory.  Lather, rinse
and repeat.



